# Source-only A41 profile. Enable the fail-closed MT6797 late-A72 capability
# owner while retaining the inherited maxcpus=8 policy and patch-0092 boot and
# disable vetoes. Every unresolved capability and attestation proof keeps the
# implementation blocked; this fragment does not request CPU8 or CPU9.
CONFIG_ARM64_MT6797_A72_CAPABILITY_PROFILE=y
CONFIG_LOCALVERSION="-gemini-a41-blocked"
